(
    schema_version: 12,
    title: "Demo",
    strings: (
        source_lang: "en",
        entries: {
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000001": "Alice",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000002": "Bob",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000003": "Welcome back, runner. The city remembers you: you have already finished this story at least once.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000004": "Neo-Kyoto, 2087. Rain hammers the megatower blocks while neon bleeds across every wet window.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000005": "In a cramped capsule above the Sprawl, a hacker is wide awake.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000006": "Another night, another contract. Tonight I want something that pays well and bites back.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000007": "Someone knocks at the door. Twice, then once: the fixer\'s signal.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000008": "Sorry to wake you, Alice. A corp called Helix just lost something, and they want it back, quietly.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000009": "Define \"something\".",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000010": "A neural chip, prototype. Rumour says it holds an AI that woke up. Interested?",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000011": "Take the job for the standard fee.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000012": "Haggle: you want a bigger advance.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000013": "Ask about the AI.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000014": "Refuse and go back to sleep.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000015": "\"I heard the chip is called Ghost.\" (you remember a past run)",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000016": "Fifty credits up front. Deal.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000017": "You are pushing it, Alice.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000018": "...But your name carries weight in the Sprawl. A hundred credits, and not a coin more.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000019": "Nobody knows you yet. Thirty credits, take it or leave it.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000020": "Helix says it is a bug. I say it is a person. Whatever it is, it does not want to be found.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000021": "Where did you hear that name? Never mind. You are in, and you get the premium channel.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000022": "Sorry, Bob. I am done for tonight.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000023": "Then I will find someone braver.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000024": "You sleep through the night. The city goes on without you.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000025": "The door closes behind Bob. Time to hit the street.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000026": "The Sprawl: noodle stalls, holo-ads, drones humming overhead.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000027": "Sirens everywhere. I should not have tripped that alarm...",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000028": "Where to?",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000029": "Break into the Helix tower. (needs the access chip)",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000030": "Visit the black market.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000031": "Visit the ripperdoc clinic.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000032": "Take a moment to rest.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000033": "Call Bob and wrap this up. (needs reputation)",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000034": "You sip synth-coffee under a flickering sign. Heat goes down, but so do your savings.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000035": "At least my wallet is full.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000036": "My wallet is nearly empty.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000037": "Under a rusty overpass, the black market hums with whispered deals.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000038": "Looking for an access chip? I know a seller.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000039": "Buy the access chip (60 credits).",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000040": "Leave the market.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000041": "Sell some stolen data (+40 credits, more heat).",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000042": "Pleasure doing business. Do not lose it.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000900": "Before leaving, let me check what I am carrying.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000043": "Stolen data attracts attention. Be careful.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000044": "The ripperdoc\'s clinic smells of ozone and antiseptic. Chrome gleams on every shelf.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000045": "One implant, please. Something to help me sneak into a corporate tower.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000046": "Install a neural booster (50 credits).",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000047": "Get a free checkup (+1 reputation).",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000048": "Leave.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000049": "The needle hums. For a few seconds, the whole world slows down.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000050": "Perfect. I can see the code behind the walls.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000051": "The doc hums and writes a scrawl. Word spreads that you are a regular.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000052": "The Helix tower rises like a blade. Its lobby is a cathedral of glass and light.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000053": "The chip works. The doors recognise me as staff.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000054": "With the booster, you read the guards\' patrol patterns like an open book.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000055": "A guard glances your way. Your heartbeat is deafening.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000056": "You reach the server room. A terminal blinks with a single prompt.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000057": "Hack the terminal.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000058": "Force the lock by brute force (noisy).",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000059": "The lock shatters. An alarm screams through the whole tower.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000060": "Lines of green code cascade down the terminal. You have three attempts.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000061": "Inject the old Helix backdoor.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000062": "Brute-force the cipher.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000063": "Listen to what the AI says.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000064": "A soft voice echoes in your skull: \"Please... do not let them take me back.\"",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000065": "Access denied. The firewall pushes back hard.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000066": "The terminal locks. Somewhere, a silent alarm turns red.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000067": "The firewall falls. Inside, a presence waits: the AI called Ghost.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000068": "Dawn paints the megatowers pink and orange. On the rooftop, Bob is waiting.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000069": "You tripped every alarm in the district! Helix will tear the city apart.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000070": "Clean work, Alice. You really are the best.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000071": "So. What do we do with the chip? Helix pays a fortune, but the AI deserves better.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000072": "Give the chip to Helix (+200 credits).",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000073": "Free the AI on the open net. (you spoke with Ghost)",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000074": "Destroy the chip.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000075": "Run with Bob.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000076": "Helix has the money. I need it more than I need a conscience tonight.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000077": "Run, Ghost. Be free.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000078": "I thought you would say that.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000079": "Come on! Before the drones arrive!",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000080": "ENDING 1: \"The Quiet Life\". You wake up later, richer in sleep than in credits.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000081": "ENDING 2: \"Corporate Handshake\". Helix keeps its AI. You keep a comfortable apartment.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000082": "ENDING 3: \"Ghost in the Net\". Somewhere, an old intelligence smiles and travels the world.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000083": "ENDING 4: \"Burnt Chrome\". Nobody gets the chip; everybody gets a story to tell.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000084": "ENDING 5: \"Two Runners\". You and Bob disappear into the neon rain.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000085": "Your reputation: legendary. Your name is whispered in every alley.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000086": "The music fades away.",
            "01JBX0T0000000000000000087": "Thank you for playing the OrbitEngine demo!",
        },
    ),
